  {
   "id": "matematicas-2006-reserva-1-2",
   "n": 2,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(f\\) la función definida por \\[f(x)=\\begin{cases}e^x-1&\\text{si }x\\geq0\\\\xe^{-x^2}&\\text{si }x\\lt0\\end{cases}\\]",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Estudia la derivabilidad de \\(f\\) en \\(x=0\\) y, si es posible, calcula la derivada de \\(f\\) en dicho punto.",
     "(1,5 p.) Calcula el área del recinto limitado por la gráfica de \\(f\\), el eje de abscisas y la recta \\(x=-1\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Continuidad en \\(0\\): \\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to0^-}xe^{-x^2}=0\\) y \\(f(0)=e^0-1=0\\). Derivadas laterales:</p>\\[f'(x)=\\begin{cases}e^x&x\\gt0\\\\e^{-x^2}-2x^2e^{-x^2}=(1-2x^2)e^{-x^2}&x\\lt0\\end{cases}\\qquad f'(0^+)=1=f'(0^-)\\]<div class='res'>\\(f\\) es derivable en \\(x=0\\) y \\(f'(0)=1\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Entre \\(-1\\) y \\(0\\), \\(f(x)=xe^{-x^2}\\leq0\\): el recinto queda bajo el eje, y el área es el opuesto de la integral. Una primitiva de \\(xe^{-x^2}\\) es \\(-\\frac12e^{-x^2}\\) (casi inmediata):</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 200' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='72.0,141.4 74.2,141.4 76.3,141.4 78.5,141.4 80.7,141.4 82.8,141.4 85.0,141.4 87.2,141.4 89.3,141.4 91.5,141.4 93.7,141.4 95.8,141.4 98.0,141.4 100.2,141.4 102.3,141.4 104.5,141.4 106.7,141.4 108.8,141.4 111.0,141.4 113.2,141.4 115.3,141.4 117.5,141.4 119.7,141.4 121.8,141.4 124.0,141.4 126.2,141.4 128.3,141.4 130.5,141.4 132.7,141.4 134.8,141.4 137.0,141.4 139.2,141.4 141.3,141.4 143.5,141.4 145.7,141.4 147.8,141.4 150.0,141.4 152.2,141.4 154.3,141.4 156.5,141.4 158.7,141.4 158.7,141.4 156.5,142.8 154.3,144.1 152.2,145.5 150.0,146.8 147.8,148.2 145.7,149.5 143.5,150.7 141.3,152.0 139.2,153.2 137.0,154.3 134.8,155.4 132.7,156.5 130.5,157.5 128.3,158.5 126.2,159.4 124.0,160.2 121.8,161.0 119.7,161.7 117.5,162.3 115.3,162.9 113.2,163.4 111.0,163.8 108.8,164.2 106.7,164.5 104.5,164.7 102.3,164.9 100.2,165.0 98.0,165.0 95.8,165.0 93.7,165.0 91.5,164.8 89.3,164.7 87.2,164.4 85.0,164.1 82.8,163.8 80.7,163.5 78.5,163.1 76.3,162.6 74.2,162.2 72.0,161.7' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='20.0,148.2 21.7,148.6 23.5,148.9 25.2,149.3 26.9,149.7 28.7,150.1 30.4,150.5 32.1,150.9 33.9,151.4 35.6,151.8 37.3,152.3 39.1,152.7 40.8,153.2 42.5,153.7 44.3,154.1 46.0,154.6 47.7,155.1 49.5,155.6 51.2,156.1 52.9,156.6 54.7,157.1 56.4,157.6 58.1,158.0 59.9,158.5 61.6,159.0 63.3,159.5 65.1,159.9 66.8,160.4 68.5,160.8 70.3,161.3 72.0,161.7 73.7,162.1 75.5,162.5 77.2,162.8 78.9,163.2 80.7,163.5 82.4,163.8 84.1,164.0 85.9,164.3 87.6,164.5 89.3,164.7 91.1,164.8 92.8,164.9 94.5,165.0 96.3,165.0 98.0,165.0 99.7,165.0 101.5,164.9 103.2,164.8 104.9,164.7 106.7,164.5 108.4,164.2 110.1,164.0 111.9,163.6 113.6,163.3 115.3,162.9 117.1,162.4 118.8,161.9 120.5,161.4 122.3,160.8 124.0,160.2 125.7,159.5 127.5,158.8 129.2,158.1 130.9,157.3 132.7,156.5 134.4,155.7 136.1,154.8 137.9,153.9 139.6,152.9 141.3,152.0 143.1,151.0 144.8,150.0 146.5,149.0 148.3,147.9 150.0,146.8 151.7,145.8 153.5,144.7 155.2,143.6 156.9,142.5 158.7,141.4' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='158.7,141.4 161.1,139.8 163.4,138.3 165.8,136.6 168.2,135.0 170.6,133.2 173.0,131.5 175.3,129.7 177.7,127.8 180.1,125.9 182.5,123.9 184.9,121.9 187.3,119.8 189.7,117.7 192.0,115.5 194.4,113.2 196.8,110.9 199.2,108.5 201.6,106.0 204.0,103.5 206.3,100.9 208.7,98.3 211.1,95.5 213.5,92.7 215.9,89.8 218.3,86.8 220.6,83.8 223.0,80.6 225.4,77.4 227.8,74.1 230.2,70.7 232.6,67.1 234.9,63.5 237.3,59.8 239.7,56.0 242.1,52.1 244.5,48.1 246.9,43.9 249.2,39.7 251.6,35.3 254.0,30.8' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='72.0' y1='180.0' x2='72.0' y2='20.0' stroke='#94a3b8' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-dasharray='5 4'/><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 141.4H294.0M158.7 194.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='72.0' y1='138.4' x2='72.0' y2='144.4' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='69.0' y='155.4' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='245.3' y1='138.4' x2='245.3' y2='144.4' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='242.3' y='155.4' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='155.7' y1='86.2' x2='161.7' y2='86.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='142.7' y='90.2' font-size='10'>1</text></svg></div>\\[A=-\\int_{-1}^0xe^{-x^2}dx=-\\Bigl[-\\frac12e^{-x^2}\\Bigr]_{-1}^0=-\\left(-\\frac12+\\frac1{2e}\\right)=\\frac12-\\frac1{2e}\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac12-\\dfrac1{2e}\\approx0{,}316\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "funciones",
     "tipo": "cont",
     "apartados": "a"
    },
    {
