  {
   "id": "matematicas-2006-reserva-1-4",
   "n": 4,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(r\\) la recta de ecuación \\(\\begin{cases}x=a+t\\\\y=1-2t\\\\z=4-t\\end{cases}\\) y \\(s\\) la recta de ecuación \\(\\dfrac{x-1}2=\\dfrac{y+2}1=\\dfrac z3\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,5 p.) Calcula el valor de \\(a\\) sabiendo que las rectas \\(r\\) y \\(s\\) se cortan.",
     "(1 p.) Calcula el punto de corte."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(r\\): \\(R(a,1,4)\\), \\(\\vec u=(1,-2,-1)\\). \\(s\\): \\(S(1,-2,0)\\), \\(\\vec v=(2,1,3)\\). Los directores no son proporcionales: se cortan si y solo si el producto mixto es 0. Con \\(\\overrightarrow{RS}=(1-a,-3,-4)\\), por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[[\\overrightarrow{RS},\\vec u,\\vec v]=\\begin{vmatrix}1-a&-3&-4\\\\1&-2&-1\\\\2&1&3\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(6 a - 6+6-4\\bigr)-\\bigl(16+a - 1-9\\bigr)\\]\\[=5a-10\\]<div class='res'>\\(a=2\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Con \\(a=2\\): \\((2+t,\\ 1-2t,\\ 4-t)=(1+2\\mu,\\ -2+\\mu,\\ 3\\mu)\\). De la 2.ª, \\(\\mu=3-2t\\); en la 1.ª: \\(2+t=7-4t\\iff t=1\\), \\(\\mu=1\\). (3.ª: \\(4-1=3\\) ✓.)</p><div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":-135,\"el\":34,\"p\":[[\"line\",[1.0,3.0,5.0],[4.0,-3.0,2.0],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[4.0,-3.0,2.0],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[0.0,-2.5,-1.5],[4.2,-0.4,4.8],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[4.2,-0.4,4.8],\"s\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"pt\",[3,-1,3],\"I\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"recta\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m06r1a4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m06r1a4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m06r1a4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m06r1a4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><line x1='26.0' y1='18.0' x2='208.3' y2='123.2' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='214.3' y='123.2' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='117.2' y1='246.0' x2='159.7' y2='25.0' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='165.7' y='25.0' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>s</text><circle cx='147.5' cy='88.2' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='154.5' y='82.2' font-weight='700'>I</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='35.3' y2='263.7' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='36.3' y='265.5' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='12.7' y2='263.7' stroke='#64748